  "title": "习近平元旦前夕考察民生工作 向全国人民祝贺新年",
  "date": "2013-12-28 17:24:18",
  "author": "人民网－中国共产党新闻网",
  "editor": "(责编：王金雪                     )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p><!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n\n</p>\n<meta content=\"text/html;charset=utf-8\" http-equiv=\"content-type\"/>\n<meta content=\"utf-8\" http-equiv=\"Content-Language\"/>\n<meta content=\"all\" name=\"robots\"/>\n<meta content=\"\" name=\"description\"/>\n<meta content=\"\" name=\"keywords\"/>\n<meta content=\"1\" name=\"filetype\"/>\n<meta content=\"1\" name=\"publishedtype\"/>\n<meta content=\"2\" name=\"pagetype\"/>\n<meta content=\"373046\" name=\"catalogs\"/>\n<meta content=\"IE=EmulateIE7\" http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\"/>\n<title>习近平元旦前夕考察民生工作 向全国人民祝贺新年--人民网</title>\n<!-- style -->\n<link href=\"/img/MAIN/2012/10/112509/page.css\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<link href=\"/img/MAIN/2012/10/112509/page1.css\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n<!--top nav-->\n<div class=\"top_nav w980\">\n<a href=\"http://www.people.com.cn/\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"人民网首页\" height=\"35\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/img/MAIN/2012/10/112509/images/nav/logo.gif\" width=\"76\"/></a></div>\n<div class=\"w980\">\n<img border=\"0\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281817157201008694830.jpg\" width=\"980\"/></div>\n<div class=\"box1 mt10\">\n<div class=\"p1_content\">\n<div class=\"p1_left\">\n<div class=\"new_b1\">\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966745.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"习近平元旦前夕考察民生工作 向全国人民祝贺新年\" border=\"0\" height=\"285\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281801493076642409071.jpg\" width=\"501\"/></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p1_right\">\n<h2>\n<a href=\"NewsView.shtml?id=23968898\" target=\"_blank\">习近平元旦前夕在京看望一线职工和老年群众</a></h2>\n<p>\n    2014年元旦前夕，中共中央总书记、国家主席、中央军委主席习近平12月28日深入北京市供热企业和敬老院，考察民生工作。</p>\n<h2>\n<a href=\"NewsView.shtml?id=23969601\" target=\"_blank\">习总书记排队点餐取餐全程自己来</a></h2>\n<p>\n    没有打招呼、没有事先安排，调研归来的总书记走进庆丰包子铺，自己排队买包子，并随和地与在场市民合影留念。</p>\n<ul class=\"list_14 mt15\">\n<li>\n<a href=\"NewsView.shtml?id=23980386\" target=\"_blank\">庆丰包子铺：总书记不打招呼直接上门 非常惊讶</a></li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"NewsView.shtml?id=23980553\" target=\"_blank\">庆丰包子铺：很多人与习总书记握手合影 没有工作人员阻拦</a></li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"NewsView.shtml?id=23980919\" target=\"_blank\">庆丰包子铺：总书记叮嘱把食品安全放第一位</a></li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"NewsView.shtml?id=23967175\" target=\"_blank\">网友：习近平包子铺就餐的三个“看点”</a></li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/GB/64192/105996/368004/index.html\" target=\"_blank\"><b><font color=\"blue\">点击此处进入习近平报道专页留言板</font></b></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:none;\">\n<div class=\"line1 mt10\">\n </div>\n<div class=\"p2_content clear\">\n<div class=\"new_left\">\n </div>\n<div class=\"new_center\">\n </div>\n<div class=\"new_center\">\n </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line1 mt10\">\n </div>\n<div class=\"p2_content\">\n<h2 class=\"tit1\">\n<span>图片报道</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"mt10\">\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966596.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"习近平排队买包子 自己买单\" border=\"0\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281659044550651920479.jpg\" width=\"215\"/></a>习近平排队买包子 自己买单</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966596-2.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"习近平自己端盘子、取包子\" border=\"0\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281659045827673184417.jpg\" width=\"215\"/></a>习近平自己端盘子、取包子</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966596-8.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"习近平在包子店\" border=\"0\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281659041084526156575.jpg\" width=\"215\"/></a>习近平在包子店</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966596-5.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"习近平在包子店\" border=\"0\" height=