望敬老院的老人</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966771.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"习近平听敬老院老人们诵读《养生歌》\" border=\"0\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281659053788406689146.jpg\" width=\"215\"/></a>习近平听敬老院老人们诵读《养生歌》</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966774.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"习近平与敬老院的老人们合影\" border=\"0\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281659051726721104888.jpg\" width=\"215\"/></a>习近平与敬老院的老人们合影</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966774.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"习近平与敬老院的老人们合影\" border=\"0\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281659050834705548665.jpg\" width=\"215\"/></a>习近平与敬老院的老人们合影</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966768.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"解决环境问题要积极有为也要耐心持久\" border=\"0\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281659049814843801261.jpg\" width=\"215\"/></a>解决环境问题要积极有为也要耐心持久</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/n/2013/1228/c64094-23966745.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"习近平看望一线职工\" border=\"0\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/NMediaFile/2013/1228/MAIN201312281659037808437690164.jpg\" width=\"215\"/></a>习近平看望一线职工</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"p3_content mt10\" style=\"display:none;\">\n<div class=\"p3_left\">\n </div>\n<div class=\"p3_right\">\n </div>\n<div class=\"clear\">\n<img alt=\" \" height=\"1\" src=\"http://cpc.people.com.cn/img/MAIN/2012/10/112509/images/b5.gif\" width=\"957\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>\n<iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"431\" id=\"zhongban\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"http://t.people.com.cn/openLiveShow.action?ptopic=%CF%B0%BD%FC%C6%BD%BF%BC%B2%EC%C3%F1%C9%FA%B9%A4%D7%F7&amp;stopic=%CF%B0%BD%FC%C6%BD%BF%BC%B2%EC%C3%F1%C9%FA%B9%A4%D7%F7&amp;width=990&amp;height=431&a